      "content": "thanks. i think the scanner/IMS errors are the most likely. \n\nactually, if it is a software bug or a logging lag, do you have any ideas on how we can track if the items are disappearing due to a digital error versus them actually being physically missing from the shelf? like, how do we tell if it's just a system glitch or if something is actually getting lost in the warehouse during transit?",
